{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115843","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115843/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115843/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115843/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115843","id":3893161948,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7oDO_c","number":115843,"title":"4.6 Modern Theme: Custom Class `@icon()` colours don't map to theme colours","user":{"login":"hmturnbull","id":52052397,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDUyMzk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52052397?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmturnbull","html_url":"https://github.com/hmturnbull","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmturnbull/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmturnbull/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmturnbull/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmturnbull/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmturnbull/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmturnbull/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmturnbull/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmturnbull/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hmturnbull/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2026-02-03T20:49:37Z","updated_at":"2026-06-18T18:34:32Z","closed_at":"2026-02-04T10:27:57Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot 4.6 [89cea1439], Godot 4.4, & Godot 4.3\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 (64-bit)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen adding custom class icons via the `@icon()` annotation, the colours used in the `svg` file (colours taken directly from `godot/editor/themes/editor_color_map.cpp`) don't map to fit the editor theme.\n\n<img width=\"66\" height=\"162\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb43b4ed-fa32-4e7a-ba90-a471d250159f\" />\n\nIn this case, I'm using the **Modern** theme that's now the default in Godot 4.6, and my custom class icons still use the colours that match the **Classic** theme, no matter what icon colour scheme I select in Editor Settings.\n\nI've tried different ways of specifying the colours in the `svg` file itself, and the result is the same whether I write it as\n```<path style=\"fill:#8da5f3\"```\nor as\n```<path fill=\"#8da5f3\"```\n\nLight theme or dark theme; doesn't make a difference either.\n\nThe editor seems to be taking the fill colour as-is without mapping it to the theme's appropriate colour.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create an `svg` icon using colours specified in `editor_color_map.cpp`\n- Add a script to a node\n- specify the icon using `@icon()`\n- reload the current project\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[Icon Colours Don't Remap to Theme.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25056682/Icon.Colours.Don.t.Remap.to.Theme.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115843/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115843/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}